BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 592.0 Td (Shortly is a simple URL shortener for users who want to turn long web addresses) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 578.0 Td (into clean, shareable links. It supports generated short codes and optional custom aliases.) Tj ET
