0.930 0.950 0.970 RG 0.7 w 44.0 544.0 m 551.0 544.0 l S
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 526.0 Td (Long URLs are difficult to share, read, and remember, especially in messages or printed) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 512.0 Td (content. Shortly validates HTTP/HTTPS links, creates a unique six-character code or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 498.0 Td (accepts a valid custom alias, and stores the mapping for later use. When a short link is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.080 0.160 0.270 rg 44.0 484.0 Td (opened, the service looks up the code and redirects the user to the original URL.) Tj ET
